<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84539" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαπλά̆σι-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ον </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Alcid.
			<u>Soph.</u>
			28
		</span></i>), 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαπλᾰσι-πλήσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>many</i> (or <i>a number of) times as many</i> or <i>as
				large,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.140
			</span></i>.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α᾽; π. πρὸς πολλοστημόριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1020b27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἤπερ . . , ἢ . . ,</span>
			<i>many times as many as . ., many times more</i> or <i>larger
				than</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.50
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				530c
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				3.2.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.94
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὸς τῷ αὐτῷ
				ἀριθμῷ</span> the same <i>multiple</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Spir.</u>
				19
			</span></i>
            <u>Cor.</u>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὸς
				κατὰ τοὺς ἑξῆς ἀριθμούς</span> ib.<u>Praef.</u>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					62
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				111
			</span></i> G., <i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Aren.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				44.39
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ταχύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxag.
					9
				</span></i>
			: neut. pl. as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.5.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀναλογία,</span> prob. <i>geometrical
				progression,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APo.</u>
				78a1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαπλάσιον, τό,</span> a <i>multiple</i>: in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσάκις π.</span> equi<i>multiples,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Euc.
				5
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Def.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡσαύτως π.</span> the same
				<i>multiples,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				<i>by multiplication,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					148
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
